  "body": "This PR contains the following updates:\n\n| Package | Type | Update | Change | References |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| places.js | devDependencies | minor | `1.6.0` -> `1.11.0` | [homepage](https://community.algolia.com/places), [source](https://renovatebot.com/gh/algolia/places) |\n\n---\n\n### Release Notes\n\n<details>\n<summary>algolia/places</summary>\n\n### [`v1.11.0`](https://renovatebot.com/gh/algolia/places/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md#&#8203;1110httpsgithubcomalgoliaplacescomparev1100v1110-2018-09-17)\n\n[Compare Source](https://renovatebot.com/gh/algolia/places/compare/v1.10.0...v1.11.0)\n\n##### Bug Fixes\n\n-   **viaIP-conflict:** disable aroundLatLngViaIP when setting location ([#&#8203;554](https://renovatebot.com/gh/algolia/places/issues/554)) ([29c2473](https://renovatebot.com/gh/algolia/places/commit/29c2473))\n\n### [`v1.10.0`](https://renovatebot.com/gh/algolia/places/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md#&#8203;1110httpsgithubcomalgoliaplacescomparev1100v1110-2018-09-17)\n\n[Compare Source](https://renovatebot.com/gh/algolia/places/compare/v1.9.1...v1.10.0)\n\n##### Bug Fixes\n\n-   **viaIP-conflict:** disable aroundLatLngViaIP when setting location ([#&#8203;554](https://renovatebot.com/gh/algolia/places/issues/554)) ([29c2473](https://renovatebot.com/gh/algolia/places/commit/29c2473))\n\n### [`v1.9.1`](https://renovatebot.com/gh/algolia/places/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md#&#8203;1100httpsgithubcomalgoliaplacescomparev191v1100-2018-09-03)\n\n[Compare Source](https://renovatebot.com/gh/algolia/places/compare/v1.9.0...v1.9.1)\n\n##### Bug Fixes\n\n-   **deps:** update dependency autocomplete.js to ^0.31.0 ([9dddef2](https://renovatebot.com/gh/algolia/places/commit/9dddef2))\n\n### [`v1.9.0`](https://renovatebot.com/gh/algolia/places/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md#&#8203;190httpsgithubcomalgoliaplacescomparev180v190-2018-08-08)\n\n[Compare Source](https://renovatebot.com/gh/algolia/places/compare/v1.8.0...v1.9.0)\n\n##### Features\n\n-   **is-routing:** support instantsearch routing ([#&#8203;551](https://renovatebot.com/gh/algolia/places/issues/551)) ([05a8cdb](https://renovatebot.com/gh/algolia/places/commit/05a8cdb))\n\n### [`v1.8.0`](https://renovatebot.com/gh/algolia/places/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md#&#8203;190httpsgithubcomalgoliaplacescomparev180v190-2018-08-08)\n\n[Compare Source](https://renovatebot.com/gh/algolia/places/compare/v1.7.3...v1.8.0)\n\n##### Features\n\n-   **is-routing:** support instantsearch routing ([#&#8203;551](https://renovatebot.com/gh/algolia/places/issues/551)) ([05a8cdb](https://renovatebot.com/gh/algolia/places/commit/05a8cdb))\n\n### [`v1.7.3`](https://renovatebot.com/gh/algolia/places/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md#&#8203;180httpsgithubcomalgoliaplacescomparev173v180-2018-08-08)\n\n[Compare Source](https://renovatebot.com/gh/algolia/places/compare/v1.7.2...v1.7.3)\n\n##### Bug Fixes\n\n-   **default-location:** don't default to [0,0] for defaultPosition ([#&#8203;550](https://renovatebot.com/gh/algolia/places/issues/550)) ([9c0056c](https://renovatebot.com/gh/algolia/places/commit/9c0056c))\n\n#### [1.7.3](https://renovatebot.com/gh/algolia/places/compare/v1.7.2...v1.7.3) (2018-06-04)\n\n#### [1.7.2](https://renovatebot.com/gh/algolia/places/compare/v1.7.1...v1.7.2) (2018-05-17)\n\n#### [1.7.1](https://renovatebot.com/gh/algolia/places/compare/v1.7.0...v1.7.1) (2018-05-16)\n\n### [`v1.7.2`](https://renovatebot.com/gh/algolia/places/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md#&#8203;173httpsgithubcomalgoliaplacescomparev172v173-2018-06-04)\n\n[Compare Source](https://renovatebot.com/gh/algolia/places/compare/v1.6.0...v1.7.2)\n\n#### [1.7.3](https://renovatebot.com/gh/algolia/places/compare/v1.7.2...v1.7.3) (2018-06-04)\n\n</details>\n\n---\n\n### Renovate configuration\n\n:date: **Schedule**: \"every weekend\" in timezone Europe/Paris.\n\n:vertical_traffic_light: **Automerge**: Enabled.\n\n:recycle: **Rebasing**: Whenever PR is stale, or if you modify the PR title to begin with \"`rebase!`\".\n\n:no_bell: **Ignore**: Close this PR and you won't be reminded about this update again.\n\n---\n\nThis PR has been generated by [Renovate Bot](https://renovatebot.com/gh/marketplace/renovate). View repository job log [here](https://renovatebot.com/dashboard#algolia/instantsearch.js).",
